      "summary": "Dear ROS Community, We are excited to share an official summary and recap of ROSCon China 2026 ! Held from October 16–18, 2026 at Shanghai, China , ROSCon China 2026 came together for 3 action-packed days of technical sessions, workshops, and networking. The scale and enthusiasm this year exceeded all expectations, bringing together developers, researchers, students, and industry leaders from across China and around the world. Some Numbers Date & Location: Oct 16-18, 2026 | Shanghai, China 3 Days of intensive tech talks, hands-on training, and networking 1,000+ Attendees joined in person 300+ Companies & Organizations represented 30 Exhibitors showcasing cutting-edge hardware, sensors, and platforms 50 Keynotes & Technical Reports presented across specialized tracks 3 Specialized Courses & 1 Hands-on Workshop 1 Closed-Door Strategic Exchange Session bringing together key industry and academic leaders A heartfelt thank you to all 1,000+ attendees, 300+ participating companies, 30 exhibitors, speakers, and local organizers who made ROSCon China 2026 in Shanghai such a resounding success. Your enthusiasm and dedication continue to push the boundaries of open-source robotics. Xinyu Zha",
