      "title": "Radar Plugin for Gazebo.",
      "link": "https://discourse.openrobotics.org/t/radar-plugin-for-gazebo/59153",
      "summary": "I’m currently developing a marine radar sensor plugin for Gazebo Harmonic with ROS 2 integration, designed to be mounted on a USV for testing obstacle detection and avoidance in simulation. The plugin publishes three outputs: a PPI (Plan Position Indicator) radar image, a point cloud of radar returns, and a list of detected targets. Range is configurable, so the same sensor can be reused across different vessels and scenarios. 1 post - 1 participant Read full topic",
