      "title": "Anthropic SDK v2.3.0",
      "link": "https://github.com/anthropics/anthropic-sdk-python/releases/tag/v2.3.0",
      "summary": "Features api: add Claude Tag endpoints for Claude Enterprise organizations Bug Fixes google-cloud: send user profiles requests to the organization endpoint Chores client: stop sending query params hardcoded in endpoint paths docs: improve the descriptions of the code execution tool and its encrypted results docs: reword work queue, skill and external key descriptions docs: update descriptions of the per-user usage and cost reports internal: carry endpoint path query params to the request layer internal: check the repository by owner and public name in workflows internal: read the beta route qualifier instead of the beta=true query internal: remove preview build upload from CI internal: stop sending the beta query param from parse and stream Documentation mcp: remove the stray await from the async tool_runner examples google-cloud: update the product name client: link the Bedrock and Vertex raw response docstrings to the SDK documentation update the README and the example request",
      "source": "GitHub (Anthropic SDK)",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-23T23:18:22+00:00",
      "releaseTag": "v2.3.0",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "section_hint": "AI",
      "articleText": "### Features\n\n* **api:** add Claude Tag endpoints for Claude Enterprise organizations\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **google-cloud:** send user profiles requests to the organization endpoint\n\n\n### Chores\n\n* **client:** stop sending query params hardcoded in endpoint paths\n* **docs:** improve the descriptions of the code execution tool and its encrypted results\n* **docs:** reword work queue, skill and external key descriptions\n* **docs:** update descriptions of the per-user usage and cost reports\n* **internal:** carry endpoint path query params to the request layer\n* **internal:** check the repository by owner and public name in workflows\n* **internal:** read the beta route qualifier instead of the beta=true query\n* **internal:** remove preview build upload from CI\n* **internal:** stop sending the beta query param from parse and stream\n\n\n### Documentation\n\n* **mcp:** remove the stray `await` from the async `tool_runner` examples\n* **google-cloud:** update the product name\n* **client:** link the Bedrock and Vertex raw response docstrings to the SDK documentation\n* update the README and the example request",
