      "title": "Ollama v0.40.11",
      "link": "https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.40.11",
      "summary": "Speech Ollama can now generate speech on macOS. ollama run plays text or a chat model's reply aloud as the audio is generated, and apps can stream audio through the OpenAI-compatible /v1/audio/speech endpoint. ollama run phonon \" Hello from Ollama.\" d3 decision models d3 brings vLLM Semantic Router's decision models to Ollama. Give a model text, structured state, or an image, and ask it to classify, answer yes or no, or score options with probabilities. The family includes 2B, 4B, 9B, and 27B sizes. ollama run d3 \" A customer says their card was charged twice.\" --ask \" Is this a billing issue?\" New Contributors @SynapShift made their first contribution in #19173 Full Changelog : v0.40.10...v0.40.11",
      "source": "GitHub (Ollama)",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T18:06:57+00:00",
      "releaseTag": "v0.40.11",
      "isPrerelease": false,
      "section_hint": "AI",
      "articleText": "## Speech\r\n\r\nOllama can now generate [speech](https://docs.ollama.com/capabilities/speech) on macOS. `ollama run` plays text or a chat model's reply aloud as the audio is generated, and apps can stream audio through the OpenAI-compatible `/v1/audio/speech` endpoint.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nollama run phonon \"Hello from Ollama.\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## d3 decision models\r\n\r\n[d3](https://ollama.com/library/d3) brings vLLM Semantic Router's decision models to Ollama. Give a model text, structured state, or an image, and ask it to classify, answer yes or no, or score options with probabilities. The family includes 2B, 4B, 9B, and 27B sizes.\r\n\r\n```sh\r\nollama run d3 \"A customer says their card was charged twice.\" --ask \"Is this a billing issue?\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @SynapShift made their first contribution in https://github.com/ollama/ollama/pull/19173\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ollama/ollama/compare/v0.40.10...v0.40.11",
      "articleUrl": "https://api.github.com/repos/ollama/ollama/releases/tags/v0.40.11",
      "articleFetchedAt": "2026-10-25T22:52:42.912864+00:00",
      "articleStatus": "fetched",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-24T00:30:13Z",
      "date": "2026-10-26"
    },
