      "summary": "Verify this release cosign verify \\ --key https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BerriAI/litellm/e82a3c646908ba0a6ee0beddc4310d7a6cac4065/cosign.pub \\ ghcr.io/berriai/litellm:v1.106.4 Same command for litellm-database , litellm-non_root and the docker.io/litellm/* images What's new in 1.106.4 3 PRs. 2 fixed. No action needed to upgrade Changes Deployment: Fixed the proxy sometimes exiting on startup with an ImportError when it cannot reach the remote model cost map, broken since v1.104.0 (#46711 ) Also in 1.104.7 , 1.105.5 Deployment: Fixed image scans flagging brotli 1.2.0, the emSign ECC Root CA - G3 and unused lockfile packages (#48283 , #48300 ) Backport #48294 · Full changelog",
      "source": "GitHub (LiteLLM)",
