    {
      "title": "Head of Robotics (Co-Founder & Partner), ROS 2 Micro-Manufacturing @ BuildShare, Remote (worldwide)",
      "link": "https://discourse.openrobotics.org/t/head-of-robotics-co-founder-partner-ros-2-micro-manufacturing-buildshare-remote-worldwide/59180",
      "summary": "Hi all, BuildShare (https://buildshare.ai ) is hiring a Head of Robotics to lead RoMi, our robotic micro-manufacturing system for building components and modules. Fully remote, worldwide. What we’re building Through Ingelica, our R&D unit, we are developing the robotics IP behind RoMi: robotic cells and production workflows that will be replicated in 500+ micro-factories across the US and run by our general-contractor partners. Our construction company, BuilderK (https://builderk.com ), delivers the homes, so the robots have real demand from day one. Where ROS / ROS 2 comes in Architect the RoMi software stack on ROS 2: cell orchestration, motion planning (MoveIt 2), perception, and hardware interfaces (ros2_control) for industrial arms and fixtures Simulate cells and workflows in Gazebo / Isaac before building hardware Turn one working cell into a repeatable, deployable package (launch, config, CI) that can run in hundreds of sites You’ll also Own the robotics roadmap, IP and team, like a CEO of the robotics business Design, prototype and test the micro-manufacturing system Present demos to partners and investors What you bring Hands-on robotics work: robots you’ve built, research",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T02:50:51+00:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-26T02:50:51+00:00",
      "source": "ROS2 Discourse",
      "section_hint": "로보틱스",
      "articleText": "Head of Robotics (Co-Founder & Partner), ROS 2 Micro-Manufacturing @ BuildShare, Remote (worldwide) - Jobs - Open Robotics Discourse Head of Robotics (Co-Founder & Partner), ROS 2 Micro-Manufacturing @ BuildShare, Remote (worldwide) Jobs fulltime richard1 October 26, 2026, 2:50am 1 Hi all, BuildShare (https://buildshare.ai ) is hiring a Head of Robotics to lead RoMi, our robotic micro-manufacturing system for building components and modules. Fully remote, worldwide. What we’re building Through Ingelica, our R&D unit, we are developing the robotics IP behind RoMi: robotic cells and production workflows that will be replicated in 500+ micro-factories across the US and run by our general-contractor partners. Our construction company, BuilderK (https://builderk.com ), delivers the homes, so the robots have real demand from day one. Where ROS / ROS 2 comes in Architect the RoMi software stack on ROS 2: cell orchestration, motion planning (MoveIt 2), perception, and hardware interfaces (ros2_control) for industrial arms and fixtures Simulate cells and workflows in Gazebo / Isaac before building hardware Turn one working cell into a repeatable, deployable package (launch, config, CI) that can run in hundreds of sites You’ll also Own the robotics roadmap, IP and team, like a CEO of the robotics business Design, prototype and test the micro-manufacturing system Present demos to partners and investors What you bring Hands-on robotics work: robots you’ve built, research, competitions, labs or startup projects ROS / ROS 2 experience, plus some of: industrial arms, controls, computer vision, CAD, embedded, automation/manufacturing Ownership: you like taking things from zero to working hardware Fluent English; at least 3 hours of overlap with US Eastern Time Early-career engineers and current students (BSc/MSc/PhD) welcome Offer Co-founder & partner role with a seat at the leadership table $150,000/year from your start date + stock options (4-year vesting, 1-year cliff) Health/dental/vision, 401(k), flexible PTO, home-office stipend, equipment and AI tools, learning budget Work from anywhere; minimum 4 hours/day, full-time welcome Apply Email richard@buildshare.ai with: CV or LinkedIn Links to your ROS / robotics work (GitHub, videos, papers, competition results) A 60-90 second intro video on why this role Subject: “Head of Robotics – ROS Discourse – Your Name” BuildShare is an equal opportunity employer. 1 Like Related topics Topic Replies Views Activity ROS2 Developer - Remote | Ctrl Robotics Jobs fulltime , ros2 , part-time , rmf , open-rmf 0 2756 October 3, 2023 Senior Robotics Architect (ROS 2) — Remote (US) | ~15% Travel Jobs ros2 , real-time , robotics , python 1 395 July 22, 2026 [Paid Contract] Robotics Engineer - Household Manipulation Prototype - Hamilton, Canada / Hybrid Jobs ros2 , ros 5 537 September 19, 2026 Robotics Software Engineer @ Logivations (ROS2, Munich, Germany and remote) Jobs fulltime , ros2 , navigation 0 1332 December 23, 2021 Senior Robotics Software Engineer at Locus Robotics (Remote or Hybrid) Jobs fulltime , ros2 , ros 0 498 October 19, 2024",
