      "title": "ROS PMC Minutes for October 20, 2026",
      "link": "https://discourse.openrobotics.org/t/ros-pmc-minutes-for-october-20-2026/59241",
      "summary": "The ROS PMC meeting for this week was on Tuesday, October 20, 2026. The notes from the meeting are available at ROS PMC weekly meeting agenda . ROS PMC Business [@ahcorde ] Votes are going out to the PMC members for: @skye.galaxy as the ROS representative to the TGC 3 new committers @christophebedard as ROSboss for M-turtle @clalancette advised checking the voting requirements against the charter , so the process is valid. @ahcorde will check. Regular Business Buildfarm update The buildfarm builds and tests ROS packages across all supported distributions and platforms. This section covers new issues, current priorities, and infrastructure changes that affect maintainers. @skye.galaxy is reviewing the open PRs that address reentrant callback group support and data races. @mjcarroll fixed the Windows CI build failures by skipping the failing multicast tests. The nightly Clang analysis jobs will be removed after months of inactivity. @mjcarroll will open a tracking issue to record the decision. Buildfarm Issues Dashboard Waffle note-taker Waffle is a weekly meeting where maintainers triage incoming issues and pull requests that haven’t been otherwise acted upon. One person per week is",
