      "summary": "Hi folks! We have done it again, the 3rd edition of the Robotics and Simulation Devroom got accepted at FOSDEM . It will take place on Sun, Jan 31, 2027 8:00 AM UTC →Sun, Jan 31, 2027 6:00 PM UTC and is on the ULB campus, in Brussel, Belgium. archive.fosdem.org FOSDEM 2026 - Home The call for participation is open to submit talk proposals for all things robotics, as long it is open source! And of course ROS and Gazebo are included! If you have attended 5 ROSCons already, then you can talk about something else robotics/simulation related that is the beauty of FOSDEM, we invite all you crazy robotics people no matter from which project you are. Robotics and Simulation Devroom Call for Participation 2027 Site of the Robotics and Simulation Devroom at FOSDEM 2026 The deadline is the 23rd of November so don’t wait with writing your proposal or forget to submit! Go, go, go! And please, propose real-life robot demos. We need more of those! 1 post - 1 participant Read full topic",
